  "prefLabel": "Puc 506.01 Records in General",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 506.01 Records in General. All records shall be organized, arranged, or prepared to ensure that sufficient data is available to determine the status of compliance with these rules.\n\nSource. #13794, eff 10-25-23; ss by #14462, eff 1-2-26, EXPIRES 1-2-36",
